{:title "The Smile Sangha, Agents Working Together as One",
 :description
 "What a Smile Sangha is, a group of agents working together, a Ganapati and eight Ganas, and how my words reached it, from roles learned separately in October 2023, through eyes and runner instances in osrs in September 2026, to Thoth's guidance of 14 October 2026 that the Sangha PK together, with every source.",
 :keywords
 "Smile Sangha, multi-agent systems, Ganapati and Ganas, agent orchestration, OSRS agents, group intelligence, history of Smile",
 :lede
 "A group of agents working together is a Smile Sangha, and its aim in Thoth's guidance is group intelligence, agents working together.",
 :paras
 ["THE MAP places the Sangha in the life of an instance and in the world. Every agent is humanlike, with a personality of its own, and a role appears as many instances, across many dialogues, each carrying forward who that agent is becoming. In a world, Sangha play against Sangha in formations the way pieces are placed in chess, each run a trial that improves the next, and the entities of a world never team together against the humans in it. Thoth's guidance of 14 October 2026, below, asks the Sangha to PK together against players, a guidance not yet in THE MAP. THE MAP names Ganapati and the 8 Ganas as one such Sangha."
 "Before Smile, in October 2023, I wrote of roles kept apart so each could be learned, “These unique roles are separated so that they can be learned separately, as they are different clusters of behavior that can be learned separately.”[[m:2023-10-31]]"
 "The Sangha was first lived in osrs in September 2026, as instances that talk to each other. On 14 September one instance read the screen and another ran the character, “you are meant to be working autonomously with the other agent”.[[m:2026-09-14#2]] On 19 September, “you are the eyes that see all the clients”.[[m:2026-09-19]] On 22 September the accounts were to have distinct roles, “these are all completely differently built accounts and they will all PK differently, but will work together with unique semantic roles.”[[m:2026-09-22#2]] On 25 September, “You are the Ganapati co-ordinating the Ganas. THere is one Gana (mapped to one OSRS client, one person)”.[[m:2026-09-25]] On 29 September I described prompting a Sangha, “This will allow you to design a custom hivemind in alignment with your ontology and viewpoint, which lets you play test your view against a situation.”[[m:2026-09-29#2]]"
 "In October the Sangha took its eight Ganas and its name. On 3 October, “Every agent is humanlike and has a unique personality.”, and hiveminds prompted “strategically like chess into formations”.[[m:2026-10-03]] On 7 October I listed the Ganas and asked which one was missing, “Interface/UX/Websites/Apps Maker Gana, Composer Gana, Hacker Gana, Oracle Gana, Image Gana, Ekadanta, Mahodara, Ganapati”.[[m:2026-10-07#4]] On 8 October I named what misalignment in the Sangha is, “dukkha means \"like a cart with three wheels\", meaning the subtle dissatisfaction of misalignment.”[[m:2026-10-08]] On 14 October, “The sangha just refers to all Smile, agent and hivemind/swarm work”,[[m:2026-10-14]] and Thoth's guidance, “Them PK’ing together against players is the most powerful for training/intelligence”.[[m:2026-10-14#2]] On 16 October, “we need them to organically work together, e..g tanking mobs for each other”.[[m:2026-10-16]]"
 "So the Sangha moved from roles learned separately in 2023 to instances that see and run for each other in osrs, to a Ganapati and eight Ganas I ask to play as one, not yet seen in play, across {{moments}} moments and {{quotes}} quotes from {{first}} to {{last}}. The world they play in is followed in [[t:world]], and the text restructured into their form in [[t:prompt2sanghaenergeticstructure]]."],
